	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Import de données (text et csv)]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=15450#p15450"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Une autre option est de créer un fichier sql de ce style :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>COPY communes_cp (libcom, comcp, libdep, codcom, dat_creat, dat_tran, user_intranet_creat, user_intranet_tran, user_db_creat, user_db_tran) FROM stdin;
L ABERGEMENT CLEMENCIAT	01400	AIN	1001	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
\.</code></pre></div><p>La table concernée :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE TABLE communes_cp (
    libcom character varying(40) NOT NULL,
    comcp character varying(5) NOT NULL,
    libdep character varying(70) NOT NULL,
    codcom character varying(5) NOT NULL,
    dat_creat timestamp without time zone,
    dat_tran timestamp without time zone,
    user_intranet_creat character varying(40),
    user_intranet_tran character varying(40),
    user_db_creat character varying(40),
    user_db_tran character varying(40)
);</code></pre></div>]]></content>
